#. Tag: author
#: details-settings.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Roger.Lum; &Roger.Lum.mail;"
msgstr "&Roger.Lum; &Roger.Lum.mail;"

#. Tag: date
#: details-settings.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "2014-08-30"
msgstr "2014-08-30"

#. Tag: releaseinfo
#: details-settings.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "4.7.01"
msgstr "4.7.01"

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; Settings"
msgstr "&kappname; Postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The settings described below modify the behavior of &kappname;. These "
"settings can be changed through <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Postavke opisane ispod podešavaju ponašanje &kappname;. Ove postavke mogu "
"biti promijenjene kroz <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Opšte"

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "Global options"
msgstr "Globalne opcije"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Price Precision"
msgstr "Preciznost cijene"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter how many digits of precision your prices will have after the decimal "
"point. For example, setting this to 2 will result in prices like 35.18, "
"where setting it to 4 might cause the same price to show 35.1791"
msgstr ""
"Unesite koliko cifara iza zareza će imati vaše cijene. Na primjer, "
"postavljanje ove opcije na 2 će rezultirati cijenama poput 35.18, a "
"postavljanje ove opcije na 4 može uzrokovati da ista cijena bude prikazana "
"kao 35.1791"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Autosave periodically"
msgstr "Periodično automatsko spašavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box if you wish &kappname; to autosave your files periodically. "
"The default is 10 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Zakačite ovaj okvir ako želite da &kappname; automatski spasi vaše datoteke "
"s vremena na vrijeme. Vrijeme koje je unaprijed podešeno je 10 minuta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your fiscal year starts on"
msgstr "Vaša fiskalna godina počinje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter the starting day and month of your fiscal year"
msgstr "Unesite početni dan i mjesec vaše fiskalne godine"

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Views options"
msgstr "Opcije pregleda"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Startup"
msgstr "Pokretanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose the initial view upon startup."
msgstr "Odaberite početni prikaz nakon pokretanja."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start with <link linkend=\"firsttime.mainwindow\">home page</link>"
msgstr "Počni sa <link linkend=\"firsttime.mainwindow\">home page</link>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start with last selected page"
msgstr "Počni sa posljednjom odabranom stranicom"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show titlebar on each page"
msgstr "Pokaži naslovni okvir na svakoj stranici"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Whether the title of the current view should be displayed on each page."
msgstr "Treba li naslov trenutnog pregleda biti prikazan na svakoj stranici."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Synchronize account selection of ledger and investment view"
msgstr ""
"Sinhroniziraj odabir računa iz glavne knjige salda i prikaz investicija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, selecting an account on the investments view "
"will change the account selection on the ledger view, and viceversa."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija odabrana, odabir računa iz prikaza investicija će "
"promijeniti odabir računa u prikazu glavne knjige salda, i obratno."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filter options"
msgstr "Opcije filtera"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not show unused categories"
msgstr "Ne prikazuj nekorištene kategorije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide unused categories."
msgstr "Sakrij nekorištene kategorije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not show closed accounts"
msgstr "Ne prikazuj zatvorene račune"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide closed accounts."
msgstr "Sakrij zatvorene račune."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show equity accounts"
msgstr "Prikaži vlasničke račune"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Equity accounts are normally hidden. Select this option to show them."
msgstr ""
"Vlasnički računi su inače sakriveni. Odaberite ovu opciju da ih prikažete."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not show finished schedules"
msgstr "Ne prikazuj dovršene rasporede"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide finished schedules."
msgstr "Sakrij dovršene rasporede."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not show transaction prior to"
msgstr "Ne prikazuj transakcije prije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide transactions prior to the selected date."
msgstr "Sakrij transakcije koje su izvršene prije odabranog datuma."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Setting this option to January 1, 1900 is a good way to debug date-related "
"file import problems."
msgstr ""
"Postavljanje ove opcije na  01.01.1900 je dobar način ispravljanje grešaka "
"koje su vezane za uvoz datoteka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not show reconciled transactions"
msgstr "Ne prikazuj usklađene transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Filter transactions by reconciliation state. Transactions that are marked as "
"<emphasis>Reconciled</emphasis> will not be shown."
msgstr ""
"Podesi filter za prikaz transakcije po stanju usklađenosti. Transakcije koje "
"su označene kao <emphasis>Usklađene</emphasis> neće biti prikazane."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Lični direktorij"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These options allow you to customize the appearance of the Home page by "
"choosing which entries to show on the Home page and the order in which they "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da podesite izgled početne stranice odabirom "
"unosa koji trebaju biti prikazani i redoslijeda kojim su prikazani."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assets and Liabilities"
msgstr "Imovina i dugovanja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "It shows the balance of all your assets and liabilities"
msgstr "Prikazuje stanje sve vaše imovine i dugovanja."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "Uplate"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "It shows the first 5 occurrences of your scheduled transactions"
msgstr "Prikazuje prvih pet pojavljivanja vaše zakazane transakcije"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preferred accounts"
msgstr "Preferirani računi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "It shows the balance and credit of your favorite accounts"
msgstr "Prikazuje stanje i konto vaših omiljenih računa"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payment accounts"
msgstr "Računi za uplate"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It shows the balance of your asset and liability accounts, except for the "
"investment accounts"
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje stanja vaših računa sa imovinom i dugovanjima, osim investicionih "
"računa"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Favorite Reports"
msgstr "Omiljeni izvještaji"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "It shows a list of your favorite reports"
msgstr "Prikazuje listu vaših omiljenih računa"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forecast (schedule)"
msgstr "Prognoza (raspored)"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "It shows a forecast for your asset and liability Accounts"
msgstr "Prikazuje prognozu za vaše račune za imovinu i dugovanja"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Net worth forecast"
msgstr "Prognoza neto vrijednosti"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "It shows a chart of your forecast net worth for the next 90 days"
msgstr "Prikazuje dijagram vaše prognoze neto vrijednosti za narednih 90 dana"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Budget"
msgstr "Budžet"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It shows the budget items for the current month which have a negative "
"difference compared to the actual income or expense"
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje stavke u budžetu za tekući mjesec koji imaju negativnu razliku u "
"poređenju sa stvarnim prihodima i rashodima"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "CashFlow"
msgstr "Protok novca"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "It shows an analysis of your cash flow for the current month"
msgstr "Prikazuje analizu protoka novca za tekući mjesec"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Percentage of default font size"
msgstr "Procenat unaprijed određene veličine fonta"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the size of the font on the Home page"
msgstr "Odaberite veličinu fonta na početnoj stranici"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remember font size when leaving the program if manually changed with mouse-"
"wheel"
msgstr ""
"Zapamti veličinu fonta prilikom napuštanja programa ukoliko je ručno "
"promijenjena točkom miša"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selecting this will save your font size preference if you have changed it "
"from the Home page by using the mouse-wheel"
msgstr ""
"Odabir ove opcije će sačuvati vašu željenu veličinu fonta ako ste je "
"promijenili na glavnoj stranici korištenjem točka na mišu"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show account limit information"
msgstr "Prikaži informacije o limitu računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows the limit of the accounts on the Payment Accounts and Preferred "
"Accounts sections of the Home page"
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje limite računa u dijelovima za Račune za uplate i Preferirane "
"račune na početnoj stranici"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show balance-status of mapped online accounts"
msgstr "Prikaži balans-status mapiranih onlajn korisničkih računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows the balance-status of mapped accounts on the Assets and Liabilities "
"Summary, the Payment Accounts and the Preferred Accounts sections of the "
"Home page. The balance-status is symbolized by an icon in the columns "
"preceding the account names. A green checkmark is displayed when online-"
"balance and local file balance are in sync. If the local file has "
"transactions newer than the previously online-updated ones a mailbox with a "
"green arrow gets shown. This alerts the user to start an online-update. "
"Mismatching local file and online-balances are highlighted by a red warning "
"sign."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje balans-status mapiranih računa u sažetku imovine i dugovanja, "
"računa za uplate i preferiranih računa na početnoj stranici. Balans-status "
"je simboliziran ikonom u koloni prije imena računa. Zelena oznaka je "
"prikazana kada su onlajn-balans i balans lokalne datoteke sinhronizirani. "
"Ako lokalna datoteka ima transakcija koje su novije od prethodnih onlajn "
"ažuriranja, pojavi se poštansko sanduče sa zelenom strelicom. Ovo upozorava "
"korisnika da treba započeti onlajn ažuriranje. Ako balans lokalne datoteke i "
"onlajn-balans nisu sinhronizirani, ovo je naznačeno crvenim znakom "
"upozorenja."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show number of not marked transactions per account [!M]"
msgstr "Pokaži broj neoznačenih transkacija po korisničkom računu [!M]"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Insert an additional column between account name and current balance showing "
"the number of not marked transactions for the accounts on the Assets and "
"Liabilities Summary, the Payment Accounts and Preferred Accounts sections of "
"the Home page"
msgstr ""
"Umetni dodatnu kolonu između imena računa i trenutnog stanja koja pokazuje "
"broj neoznačenih transakcija za račune koji se nalaze na sažetku imovine i "
"dugovanja, račune za uplate i preferirane račune početne stranice"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show number of cleared transactions per account [C]"
msgstr "Pokaži broj očišćenih transakcija po računu [C]"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Insert an additional column between account name and current balance showing "
"the number of cleared transactions for the accounts on the Assets and "
"Liabilities Summary, the Payment Accounts and Preferred Accounts sections of "
"the Home page"
msgstr ""
"Umetni dodatnu kolonu između imena računa i trenutnog stanja koja pokazuje "
"broj očišćenih transakcija za račune koji se nalaze na sažetku imovine i "
"dugovanja, račune za uplate i preferirane račune početne stranice"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Show number of not reconciled (not marked + cleared) transactions per "
"account [!R]"
msgstr ""
"Prikaži broj neusklađenih(neoznačene + očišćene) transakcija po računu [!R]"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Insert an additional column between account name and current balance showing "
"the number of not reconciled transactions (i.e. the sum of all not marked "
"and cleared transactions) for the accounts on the Assets and Liabilities "
"Summary, the Payment Accounts and Preferred Accounts sections of the Home "
"page"
msgstr ""
"Umetni dodatnu kolonu između imena računa i trenutnog stanja koja prikazuje "
"broj neusklađenih transakcija(naprimjer suma neoznačenih i očišćenih "
"transakcija) za račune koji se nalaze na sažetku imovine i dugovanja, račune "
"za uplate i preferirane račune početne stranice"

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ledger"
msgstr "Glavna knjiga salda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These options allow you to modify the behavior of the transaction registers."
msgstr ""
"Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da podesite ponašanje transakcijskih spremnika."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display tab"
msgstr "Kartica prikaza"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show a grid in the register"
msgstr "Prikaži rešetku u spremniku"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show grid lines in the transaction register."
msgstr "Prikaži crte rešetke u transakcijskom spremniku."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the ledger lens"
msgstr "Koristi uvećanje knjige"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, the ledger will show all lines of detail for the "
"transaction you have currently selected, even if you have set the <link "
"linkend=\"reference.menus.settings.transactiondetail\">Show Transaction "
"Detail</link> menu option turned off."
msgstr ""
"Sa ovom uključenom opcijom, knjiga salda će prikazati sve linije detalja za "
"transakciju koja je trenutno odabrana, čak iako ste postavili  <link linkend="
"\"reference.menus.settings.transactiondetail\">Prikaži detalje transakcija</"
"link> opciju u meniju na isključeno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show transaction form"
msgstr "Pokaži obrazac transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Show the <link linkend=\"details.ledger.transactionform\">transaction form</"
"link> at the bottom of the transaction register for entering and editing "
"transactions. With this option turned off, you edit the transaction within "
"the register itself."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži <link linkend=\"details.ledger.transactionform\">obrazac "
"transakcije</link> na dnu transakcijskog spremnika za unos i uređivanje "
"transakcija. Kada je ova opcija isključena, uređujete transakcije u samom "
"spremniku."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Always show a No. field"
msgstr "Uvijek prikaži polje sa brojem"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Always have the number (<quote>No.</quote>) field when entering or editing a "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Neka je uvijek tu polje za broj(<quote>No.</quote>) prilikom unosa ili "
"uređivanja transakcije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show group header between transactions"
msgstr "Prikaži grupno zaglavlje između transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display group headers in the register"
msgstr "Prikaži grupna zaglavlja u spremniku"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show header for the previous and current fiscal year"
msgstr "Prikaži zaglavlje za prethodnu i tekuću fiskalnu godinu"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display group headers for the current and the previous fiscal year"
msgstr "Prikaži grupna zaglavlja za tekuću i prethodnu fiskalnu godinu"

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sorting tab"
msgstr "Kartica sortiranja"

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Normal view tab"
msgstr "Kartica normalnog prikaza"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose the sort order of the ledger while in the Normal view."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite redoslijed sortiranja knjige salda dok ste u normalnom prikazu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reconciliation view tab"
msgstr "Kartica prikaza usklađenosti"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose the sort order of the ledger while in the Reconciliation view."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite redoslijed sortiranja knjige salda dok se nalazite u prikazu "
"usklađenosti."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:390
#, no-c-format
msgid "Search view tab"
msgstr "Kartica prikaza pretrage"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose the sort order of the ledger while in the Search view."
msgstr "Odaberite redoslijed sortiranja dok se nalazie u prikazu pretrage."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Data Entry tab"
msgstr "Kartica unosa podataka"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid "Insert transaction type into No. field for new transactions"
msgstr "Umetni tip transakcije u polje 'broj' za nove transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Automatically place the type of the transaction, &eg;., Deposit, Withdrawal, "
"etc., in the No. field."
msgstr ""
"Automatski smjesti tip transakcije,  &eg;., Depozit, Podizanje novca, itd, u "
"polje 'broj'."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto increment check number"
msgstr "Automatski uvećavaj broja čeka"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Have the check number automatically increment whenever entering a new check "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Neka se broj čeka automatski uvećava prilikom unosa nove čekovne transakcije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keep changes when selecting a different transaction/split"
msgstr "Zadrži promjene pri odabiru različite transakcije/razdvajanja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When enabled, selecting a different transaction or split will save edits to "
"the current transaction."
msgstr ""
"Kada je uključeno, odabir različite transakcije/razdvajanja će sačuvati "
"promjene trenutne transakcije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When disabled, selecting a different transaction will cancel them. Instead, "
"you must explicitly accept the changes."
msgstr ""
"Kada je isključeno, odabir različite transakcije će otkazati promjene. "
"Umjesto toga, morate eksplicitno prihvatiti promjene."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use Enter to move between fields"
msgstr "Koristi Enter za kretanje između polja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When enabled, pressing Enter will change the focus to the next field of the "
"transaction form."
msgstr ""
"Kada je uključeno, pritisak na Enter će pomjeriti fokus na sljedeće polje "
"transakcijskog obrasca."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:437
#, no-c-format
msgid "Match names from start"
msgstr "Poveži imena od početka"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Mark this option if you always want to match names &eg;, for payees from the "
"start. If unset, any substring is matched"
msgstr ""
"Označite ovu opciju ukoliko želite da imena uvijek budu povezana &eg;, za "
"primatalje uplata od samog početka. Ako ova opcija nije označena, povezaće "
"bilo koji podniz znakova."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid "Default reconciliation state"
msgstr "Zadano stanje usklađivanja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the default reconciliation state for new transactions."
msgstr "Odaberite zadano stanje usklađivanja za nove transakcije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Autofill"
msgstr "Automatsko popunjavanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the desired behavior for autofill or deactivate it"
msgstr ""
"Podesite željeno ponašanje za automatsko popunjavanje ili ga deaktivirajte"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "No Autofill"
msgstr "Bez automatskog popunjavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid "Same transaction if amount differs less than X percent"
msgstr "Ista transakcija ako se iznos razlikuje za manje od X posto"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When entering a new transaction with this option, &kappname; will display a "
"list of previous transaction for the payee and account. If previous "
"transactions differ in less than X percent, they will be considered "
"identical. If the percentage is 0, all previous transactions for the payee "
"and account will be displayed. When selecting a transaction, all "
"transactions details except the date will be autofilled with those of the "
"selected transaction."
msgstr ""
"Kada unosite novu transakciju pomoću ove opcije, &kappname; će prikazati "
"listu prethodnih transakcija za primatelja uplate i račun. Ako se prethodne "
"transakcije razlikuju za manje od X posto, smatraće se da su identične. Ako "
"je procenat 0, sve prethodne transakcije za primatelja uplate i račun će "
"biti prikazane. Kada odabirate transakciju, svi detalji transakcije osim "
"datuma će biti automatski popunjeni onima sa odabrane transakcije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid "With previously most often used transaction for the payee"
msgstr "Sa prethodno najćešće korištenim transakcijama za primatelja uplate"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:473
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When entering a new transaction with this option enabled, &kappname; will "
"fill in all the transaction details based on the previously most often used "
"transaction with the selected payee."
msgstr ""
"Kada unosite novu transakciju sa ovom opcijom uključenom, &kappname; će "
"popuniti sve detalje transakcije baziranim na prethodnim najčešće korištenim "
"transakcijama sa odabranim primateljem uplate."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import tab"
msgstr "Kartica uvoza"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid "Match transaction within days"
msgstr "Upari transakciju u razmaku od određenog broja dana"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:491
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Search for matching transactions within the range of the imported "
"transaction +/- given days"
msgstr ""
"Traži odgovarajuće transakcije u opsegu uvezenih transakcija +/- dodijeljeni "
"broj dana"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ask for a new payee's default category"
msgstr "Zatraži unaprijed određenu kategoriju novog primatelja uplate"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:499
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whenever a new payee is detected during an import, the user will be asked "
"for the default category for the payee."
msgstr ""
"Kad god je pronađen novi primatelj uplate prilikom uvoza, korisnik će biti "
"upitan za unaprijed određenu kategoriju za primatelja uplate."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scheduled Transactions"
msgstr "Planirane transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:510
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These options allow you to modify the behavior of the <link linkend="
"\"details.schedules\">scheduling features</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da podesite ponašanje <link linkend=\"details."
"schedules\">osobine planiranja</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schedule startup options"
msgstr "Opcije podizanja rasporeda"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check schedules upon startup"
msgstr "Provjerite raspored na početku"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enables checking the schedule upon startup of &kappname;."
msgstr "Omogućava provjeru rasporeda prilikom podizanja &kappname;."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:527
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter transactions this number of days in advance"
msgstr "Unesite transakcije ovaj broj dana unaprijed"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify how many days in advance should the scheduled transactions be "
"entered."
msgstr ""
"Specificirajte koliko dana unaprijed bi transakcije trebale biti unesene."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:535
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of days to preview schedules in ledger"
msgstr "Broj dana uključenih u predpregled rasporeda u glavnoj knjizi salda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify how many days should the schedules show up in the ledger."
msgstr ""
"Specificirajte koliko dana bi rasporedi trebali prikazivati u glavnoj knjizi "
"salda."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:539
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The scheduled transactions will be listed in the ledger. You can enter or "
"skip the scheduled transactions by right-clicking on them."
msgstr ""
"Planirane transakcije će biti izlistane u glavnoj knjizi salda. Možete "
"unijeti ili preskočiti planirane transakcije desnim klikom na njih."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Quotes"
msgstr "Internet navodi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These settings modify how online quotes are retrieved from different online "
"sources."
msgstr ""
"Ove postavke modificiraju način dobavljanja internet navoda iz različitih "
"internet izvora."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab allows you to change the online quote sources for &kappname;. "
"Generally speaking, this is an advanced feature, and should only be "
"attempted by the most technically adept users."
msgstr ""
"Ova kartica vam omogućava da promijenite izvore internet navoda za "
"&kappname;. Uopšteno govoreći, ovo je napredna opcija, i trebali bi je "
"koristiti samo tehnički stručni korisnici."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:562
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more details, please refer to the <link linkend=\"details.investments."
"onlinequotes\">Online Price Quotes</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Za više detalja, molimo posjetite <link linkend=\"details.investments."
"onlinequotes\">Online Price Quotes</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forecast"
msgstr "Prognoza"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:573
#, no-c-format
msgid "These options allow you to modify how the forecast is calculated."
msgstr ""
"Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da modificirate kako je prognoza proračunata."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:579
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of days to forecast"
msgstr "Broj dana uključenih u prognozu"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select how many days you want to forecast. The default is 90 days"
msgstr ""
"Odaberite koliko dana želite uključiti u prognozu. Unaprijed postavljeni "
"broj dana je 90"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:587
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of days of account cycle"
msgstr "Broj dana ciklusa računa."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:589
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The normal number of days that your commonly-used accounts go through an "
"income-expense cycle. For example, if you receive your salary on a monthly "
"basis, you should select 30 days here."
msgstr ""
"Broj dana kroz koji vaši najčešće korišteni računi prolaze u obliku prihod-"
"rashod ciklusa. Naprimjer, ako primate platu svakog mjeseca, trebali biste "
"odabrati 30 dana."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:596
#, no-c-format
msgid "Day of month to start forecast"
msgstr "Dan u mjesecu za početak prognoze"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:598
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the day of the month when you want to start the forecast. This would "
"usually be the day when you receive your salary or other income."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite dan u mjesecu za početak progoze. Ovo bi inače trebao biti dana "
"kada primate platu ili neki drugi prihod."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:605
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forecast Method"
msgstr "Metoda prognoze"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:607
#, no-c-format
msgid "The forecast method to be used."
msgstr "Metoda prognoze koja će se koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:608
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scheduled and future transaction forecasts your balance based on the "
"information of your scheduled and future transactions."
msgstr ""
"Zakazane i buduće transakcije prognoziraju vaše stanje na osnovu informacija "
"o vašim zakazanim i budućim transakcijama."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid "History-based uses your past transactions to extrapolate a forecast."
msgstr ""
"Bazirano na historiji koristi vaše prošle transakcije da napravi procjenu "
"kako bi prongoza trebala izgledati."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:616
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of cycles to use in forecast"
msgstr "Broj ciklusa koji će se koristiti u prognozi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:618
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If using a history-based method, how many previous account cycles should "
"&kappname; use to calculate the forecast."
msgstr ""
"Ako koristite metodu baziranu na historiji, koliko prethodnih ciklusa bi "
"&kappname; trebao koristiti da proračuna prognozu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:624
#, no-c-format
msgid "History forecast method"
msgstr "Metoda prognoze bazirane na historiji"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the method to use when calculating a forecast based on historic "
"information"
msgstr ""
"Odaberite metodu za proračun prognoze baziranu na historijskim informacijama"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simple moving average averages your past transactions to calculate a "
"forecast."
msgstr ""
"Prosti prosjek se računa na osnovu vaših prošlih transakcija za proračun "
"prognoze."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:630
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Weighted moving average averages your past transactions, but it will give "
"more importance to the most recent transactions."
msgstr ""
"Ponderisani prosjek se računa na osnovu vaših prošlih transakcija, ali "
"pridaje više pažnje najnovijim transakcijama."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Linear regression uses a linear-regression formula based on your past "
"transactions to calculate the forecast"
msgstr ""
"Linearna regresija koristi formulu za linearnu regresiju zasnovanu na vašim "
"prethodnim transakcijama za izračunavanje prognoze."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:640
#, no-c-format
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Šifrovanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid "These options allow you to modify the data encryption settings."
msgstr ""
"Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da modificirate postavke šifrovanja podataka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:648
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use GPG encryption"
msgstr "Koristite GPG šifriranje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:650
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enables the use of GPG to encrypt data file. See the section on <link "
"linkend=\"details.formats.encrypted\">GPG Encryption</link> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje korištenje GPG za šifriranje podataka. Pogledajete dio na <link "
"linkend=\"details.formats.encrypted\">GPG Šifriranje</link> za više detalja."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:658
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPG Encryption"
msgstr "GPG šifriranje"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your key"
msgstr "Vaš ključ"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:664
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the email address or the hexadecimal key id to use for data encryption."
msgstr ""
"Unesite email adresu ili heksadecimalni id ključ koji će se koristiti za "
"šifriranje podataka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:670
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional keys"
msgstr "Dodatni ključevi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:672
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select additional keys to use for data encryption."
msgstr "Odaberite dodatne ključeve koje ćete koristiti za šifriranje podataka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:677
#, no-c-format
msgid "Also encrypt with kmymoney-recover key"
msgstr "Takođe šifriraj sa kmymoney-povratak ključem"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:679
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Encrypts data with the &kappname; recover key. Selecting this option will "
"allow core &kappname; developers to decrypt your data file in case you lose "
"your encryption key."
msgstr ""
"Šifrira podtke sa &kappname; ključem za povratak. Odabir ove opcije će "
"dozoliti &kappname; ključnim razvojnim inženjerima da dešifruju vaše podatke "
"u slučaju da izgubite vaš ključ šifriranja."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:689
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Boje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:691
#, no-c-format
msgid "These options allow you to change colors within &kappname;."
msgstr "Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da promijenite boje u &kappname;."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:696
#, no-c-format
msgid "Foreground tab"
msgstr "Kartica prednjeg plana"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:698
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Modify any of the foreground colors by clicking on the color button and "
"opening a color select palette."
msgstr ""
"Podesite bilo koju od boja u prednjem planu klikom na tipku za boju i "
"otvaranjem palete za odabir boja."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background tab"
msgstr "Pozadinska kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:707
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Modify any of the background colors by clicking on the color button and "
"opening a color select palette."
msgstr ""
"Podesite bilo koju od pozadinskih boja klikom na tipku za boju i otvaranjem "
"palete za odabir boja."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:712
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note the <guilabel>Use system colors</guilabel> checkbox at the top of the "
"tab. If this is checked, &kappname; uses colors provided by the system, such "
"as those associated with a selected theme, although the details depend on "
"which operating system and possibly which window system or display manager "
"is running. Very often, if you experience odd colors or odd combination of "
"colors, toggling this checkbox will help."
msgstr ""
"Zakačite <guilabel>Koristi sistemske boje</guilabel> komandni okvir na vrhu "
"kartice. Ako je ovo zakačeno, &kappname; koristi boje koje su predviđene "
"sistemom, kao što su one koje su povezane sa nekom od tema, iako detalji "
"zavise od operativnog sistema. Također je moguće da zavise od sistema "
"prozora ili prikaznog menadžera. U većini slučajeva, ukoliko se pojave čudne "
"boje ili kombinacije boja, odabir ove opcije će pomoći."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:724
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Fontovi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:726
#, no-c-format
msgid "These options allow you to modify the fonts."
msgstr "Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da podesite fontove."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:732
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use system fonts"
msgstr "Koristi fontove sistema"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:734
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this to use system fonts. Deselecting this option allows you to "
"customize fonts."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovo za korištenje fontova sistema. Ukoliko ova opcija nije "
"odabrana, možete podesiti fontove kako vam odgovara."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:740
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cell font"
msgstr "Font ćelije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:742
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify the custom font to use within each cell."
msgstr "Specificirajte koji font želite koristiti u svakoj od ćelija."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:747
#, no-c-format
msgid "Header font"
msgstr "Font zaglavlja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:749
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify the custom font to use for the headers of each view."
msgstr ""
"Specificirajte koji font želite koristiti za svako od zaglavlja svakog "
"pregleda."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:756
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Dodaci"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:758
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These options allow you to modify the behavior of any installed plugins. "
"Note that the list of plugins displayed will depend on which plugins "
"&kappname; found when it started. It does not matter whether the plugin was "
"compiled as part of the application or added as a separate package. "
"<screenshot> <screeninfo>Configure Plugins</screeninfo> <mediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"configure_plugins.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Configure Plugins</phrase> </textobject> "
"</mediaobject> </screenshot> For most plugins, the only choice is to enable "
"or disable it, as indicated by the checkbox next to the name of the plugin. "
"In addition, there is also an <guibutton>information</guibutton> "
"(&infoicon;) button for each, which will show the plugin version and author. "
"Further information on configuring and using these plugins may be found in "
"the separate sections for <link linkend=\"details.impexp.csv\">CSV Import</"
"link> and <link linkend=\"details.impexp.ofx\">OFX Import</link> plugins. It "
"is also true for the <link linkend=\"details.reconcile\">Reconciliation "
"report</link>, although that report is only a minor part of the larger "
"reconciliation process. The one plugin that does require a configuration "
"step is the Print Check plugin."
msgstr ""
"Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da podesite ponašanje instaliranih dodataka. "
"Imajte na umu da će prikaz liste dodataka zavisiti od toga koje je dodatke "
"je &kappname; pronašao kada je pokrenut. Nije važno je li dodataka bio "
"kompajliran kao dio aplikacije ili dodan kao odvojeni paket. <screenshot> "
"<screeninfo>Konfiguriši Dodatke</screeninfo> <mediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"configure_plugins.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"<textobject> <phrase>Konfiguriši Dodatke</phrase> </textobject> </"
"mediaobject> </screenshot> Za većinu dodataka, jedine opcije su uključiti ih "
"ili isključiti, kao što je naznačeno od strane komandnog okvira pored imena "
"dodatka. Dodatno, tu je također i <guibutton>informacije</guibutton> "
"(&infoicon;) tipka za svaki, koja će prikazati verziju dodatka i autora. "
"Dodatne informacije o konfigurisanju i korištenju ovih dodataka mogu biti "
"pronađene u odvojenim dijelovima za <link linkend=\"details.impexp.csv\">CSV "
"Uvoz</link> i <link linkend=\"details.impexp.ofx\">OFX Uvoz</link> dodatke. "
"Također je tačno za <link linkend=\"details.reconcile\">Izvještaj o "
"usklađivanju</link>, iako je taj izvještaj samo mali dio većeg procesa "
"usklađivanja. Jedini dodatak koji zahtijeva korak konfiguracije je dodatak "
"Isprintaj Račun."

#. Tag: title
#: details-settings.docbook:787
#, no-c-format
msgid "Print check plugin"
msgstr "Dodatak za printanje računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:789
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This plugin is included with the source of &kappname;, and should always be "
"enabled. It allows printing of a check based on the data from a selected "
"transaction, with the layout controlled by an html template. You need to use "
"a template which is matched to your pre-printed checks. When you click on "
"the <guibutton>configure</guibutton> (&configicon;) button , the "
"<guilabel>Print check</guilabel> configuration dialog is displayed. At the "
"top is a text box for the path to the selected template. To the right of "
"that is a button which brings up a file chooser, to select an alternative "
"template file."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dodatak je uključen sa izvornim &kappname;, i uvijek bi trebao biti "
"uključen. Omogućava printanje računa na osnovu podataka o  odabranoj "
"transakciji, sa izgledom kontrolisanim html šablonom. Trebate koristiti "
"šablon koji odgovara vašim računima prije printanja. Kada kliknete na dugme "
"<guibutton>konfiguriši</guibutton> (&configicon;), prikaže se dijalog za "
"konfiguraciju <guilabel>Printaj račun</guilabel>. Na vrhu se nalazi tekstni "
"okvir za putanju do odabranog šablona. Desno od toga se nalazi dugme koje "
"služi za prikaz opcije u kojoj možete odabrati datoteku, koje služi za "
"odabir alternativne datoteke za šablon."

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:800
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A template file is an html file, in which specific strings are used to "
"reference the fields from the transaction and from the current account and "
"institution to show where they will be printed on the check. &kappname; is "
"shipped with some sample template files. You should either be able to use "
"one of them, or modify one to suit your needs. When the default template is "
"selected, the configuration dialog will show you the directory which "
"contains the sample files."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka za šablon je html datoteka, u kojoj se nalaze specifični nizovi "
"znakova koji se koriste za povezivanje polja transakcije i trenutnog računa "
"i institucije za prikaz mjesta njihovog prinatanja na računu. &kappname; "
"dođe opskrbljen sa nekim primjerima šablona. Trebali biste korisiti jedan od "
"njih, ili modificirati neki od njih tako da vam odgovara. Kada se odabere "
"unaprijed definisani šablon, dijalog za konfiguraciju će vam pokazati "
"direktorij u kojem se nalaze primjeri šablona."
